      "content": "hey, i need some help. my neighbor has this huge automated hydroponic setup in their yard and it's been running constant misting cycles lately. every time it goes, there's this really heavy, sweet scent that hangs in the air for hours. honestly, it's making me feel super lightheaded and anxious, like i can't catch my breath right. do you know any ways i can neutralize the airborne particulates coming from their garden so it stops hitting my house?",
